  "matching": "TRAILING_MAX_SENTINEL",
  "entries": [
    {
      "ordinal": 0,
      "label": "sdc01_0020_bbteacher_01",
      "hash64": "0821B05AC6B633BC",
      "text": "[VAR 0x0100(0000)]，\\n[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳準備好要前往北上鄉了嗎？[VAR 0x0114(0042)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 0,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 6,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 25,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0042"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "sdc01_0020_bbteacher_02",
      "hash64": "0821B35AC6B638D5",
      "text": "[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳隨時都能回來帕底亞，\\n不用大張旗鼓地準備也沒關係的。[VAR 0x0114(0042)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 0,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 33,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0042"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "sdc01_0020_bbteacher_03",
      "hash64": "0821B25AC6B63722",
      "text": "好！等其他學生都到齊了，\\n我們就出發吧！\\c\\n我聽說參加的學生是用抽籤決定的，\\n彼此都是第一次見面。[VAR 0x0114(0042)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 20,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 51,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0042"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "sdc01_0020_bbteacher_04",
      "hash64": "0821AD5AC6B62EA3",
      "text": "雖然我是大家的領隊，\\n但我自己也會享受夏令營的。[VAR 0x0114(0042)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 24,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0042"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "sdc01_0020_bbteacher_05",
      "hash64": "0821AC5AC6B62CF0",
      "text": "……對了，\\n[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳知道《朱之書》嗎？[VAR 0x0114(0042)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 6,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 22,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0042"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "sdc01_0020_bbteacher_06",
      "hash64": "0821AF5AC6B63209",
      "text": "……對了，\\n[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳知道《紫之書》嗎？[VAR 0x0114(0042)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 6,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 22,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0042"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "sdc01_0020_select_01",
      "hash64": "D05D8F35FD616BF2",
      "text": "知道",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "sdc01_0020_select_02",
      "hash64": "D05D8E35FD616A3F",
      "text": "不知道",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "sdc01_0020_bbteacher_07",
      "hash64": "0821AE5AC6B63056",
      "text": "真不愧是本世紀出名的超自然書籍。[VAR 0x0114(0042)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 16,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0042"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "sdc01_0020_bbteacher_08",
      "hash64": "0821B95AC6B64307",
      "text": "哦？真是意外。\\n這所學校應該也有收到捐贈才對。[VAR 0x0114(0042)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 23,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0042"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "sdc01_0020_bbteacher_09",
      "hash64": "0821B85AC6B64154",
      "text": "那本書的作者海哲，\\n是我的祖先。[VAR 0x0114(0042)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 16,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0042"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "sdc01_0020_bbteacher_10",
      "hash64": "081E2B5AC6B31BE6",
      "text": "我擁有他的原版書。[VAR 0x0114(0042)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 9,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0042"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "sdc01_0020_bbteacher_11",
      "hash64": "081E2C5AC6B31D99",
      "text": "[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳看，這是在出版的書裡\\n被塗黑而無法閱讀的頁面。[VAR 0x0114(0042)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 0,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 30,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0042"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "sdc01_0020_bbteacher_12",
      "hash64": "081E295AC6B31880",
      "text": "這上面描繪的寶可夢，\\n名字叫[VAR 0xFF00(0006)]太樂巴戈斯[VAR 0xFF00(0000)]。[VAR 0x0114(0042)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 14,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 23,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 28,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0042"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "sdc01_0020_bbteacher_13",
      "hash64": "081E2A5AC6B31A33",
      "text": "據說海哲在第零區的更深處\\n遇到了這隻神秘的寶可夢。\\r\\n……雖然世人們都不相信這件事。[VAR 0x0114(0042)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 25,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 44,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0042"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "sdc01_0020_bbteacher_14",
      "hash64": "081E2F5AC6B322B2",
      "text": "我的夢想是找到太樂巴戈斯，\\n證明海哲是正確的。[VAR 0x0114(0042)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 23,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0042"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "sdc01_0020_bbteacher_15",
      "hash64": "081E305AC6B32465",
      "text": "……話雖如此，我到現在都\\n還沒得到進入第零區的許可。[VAR 0x0114(0042)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 26,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0042"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "sdc01_0020_bbteacher_16",
      "hash64": "081E2D5AC6B31F4C",
      "text": "哎呀，沒關係的。\\n我打算去做現在能做的事。[VAR 0x0114(0042)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 21,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0042"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "sdc01_0020_student1_01",
      "hash64": "A97DD108C793D8D8",
      "text": "白蕾雅老師！\\n我們準備好了！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "sdc01_0020_bbteacher_17",
      "hash64": "081E2E5AC6B320FF",
      "text": "看來人都到齊了。[VAR 0x0114(0042)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 8,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0042"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "sdc01_0020_bbteacher_18",
      "hash64": "081E335AC6B3297E",
      "text": "那麼，大家！\\n我們往北上鄉出發吧！[VAR 0x0114(0042)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 17,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0042"
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
